      "depends_on": [1, 2, 3]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "claim": "Therefore, an uninsured person is more likely than an insured person to decline a CT scan.",
      "evidence": "Because uninsured patients face the full cost while insured patients face only a reduced copay, the financial barrier is greater for the uninsured, leading to higher refusal rates observed in empirical data.",
